            "review_title": "Review at Nam Chau Seafood Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Алина\nSochi, Russia178 contributions\n0\nDelicious seafood!\nSep 2026 • Couples\nIt was really delicious here! We ordered a spicy seafood salad with shrimp and oysters—and perhaps these are some of the most delicious seafood we have tried in Da Nang. Everything was fresh, perfectly cooked, and truly impressive.\n\nI especially liked the wide variety of seafood - there is something to choose from. The restaurant itself is located on a quiet, calm street, so it is very pleasant to sit here and not rush anywhere.\n\nWe were very pleased and will definitely come back here again!\nRead more\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten September 17, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
