            "review_text": "Dreamer07544480437\nDa Nang, Vietnam10 contributions\n0\nSecond Visit to Nam Chau Seafood: Must-Try Lobster Rice and Delicious Garlic Butter Prawns!\nJan 2025 • Family\nThis is my second visit here, and the dishes still retain the flavors I love. The garlic butter freshwater prawns are deliciously rich and fragrant. The restaurant has now added a new dish, fried lobster rice, and it's absolutely amazing! The lobster is packed with meat, and the egg rice melts in your mouth—it’s a must-try when you visit. I also ordered the Thai-style steamed clams with a Korean twist, and the clams were perfectly seasoned. Plus, the prices here are more affordable compared to other seafood restaurants I’ve been to.\nWritten February 4, 2025",
